module-whatis       "Multi-dimensional image viewer for python"
module-url          "https://github.com/napari/napari"
module-license      "BSD-3-Clause license"
module-maintainer   "João Pedro Agostinho de Sousa <joao.agostinho-de-sousa@psi.ch>"

module-help         "
napari is a fast, interactive, multi-dimensional image viewer for Python. It's
designed for browsing, annotating, and analyzing large multi-dimensional
images. It's built on top of Qt (for the GUI), vispy (for performant GPU-based
rendering), and the scientific Python stack (numpy, scipy).
"

